{"seq":1,"slug":"rotating-magnetic-field-and-induction-motor","title":"旋转磁场与交流感应电动机","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/major-works/polyphase-ac-system/rotating-magnetic-field-and-induction-motor","wordCount":1542,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"旋转磁场与交流感应电动机\">旋转磁场与交流感应电动机</h1><p>1888 年 5 月 16 日，三十一岁的特斯拉站在哥伦比亚学院的讲台上，向美国电气工程师学会（AIEE）宣读《交流电动机与变压器的新系统》。台下的工程师们第一次看到一台没有电刷、没有换向器、却能凭空起转的电动机。它的秘密不在机械结构，而在一个看不见的物理现象——旋转磁场。这篇演讲，连同同年获批的一组专利，被普遍视为现代电力工业的奠基文献。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>直流电动机依赖换向器（commutator）和电刷不断切换电流方向以维持转矩，这带来火花、磨损与高昂的维护成本。特斯拉的突破在于：用多路相位错开的交流电分别激励空间上错开的定子绕组，使合成磁场本身在空间中连续旋转；转子在这个旋转磁场中被感应出电流，进而产生自身磁场，二者相互作用拖动转子跟随旋转。整个过程没有任何滑动电接触。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[多相交流电源] --&gt; B[空间错开的定子绕组]&#10;  B --&gt; C[合成磁场在空间旋转]&#10;  C --&gt; D[转子中感应出电流]&#10;  D --&gt; E[转子磁场与旋转磁场相互作用]&#10;  E --&gt; F[转子被拖动旋转]&#10;  F -.转速略低于同步.-&gt; C\">flowchart LR\n  A[多相交流电源] --&gt; B[空间错开的定子绕组]\n  B --&gt; C[合成磁场在空间旋转]\n  C --&gt; D[转子中感应出电流]\n  D --&gt; E[转子磁场与旋转磁场相互作用]\n  E --&gt; F[转子被拖动旋转]\n  F -.转速略低于同步.-&gt; C</pre><p>下表对比直流电动机与特斯拉的交流感应电动机：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>直流电动机</th>\n<th>交流感应电动机（特斯拉）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>换向方式</td>\n<td>换向器 + 电刷</td>\n<td>无，靠旋转磁场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电接触磨损</td>\n<td>显著</td>\n<td>几乎无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>起动</td>\n<td>需辅助</td>\n<td>自起动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护成本</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合远距离供电</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（配合变压器）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"1882-1887-从直觉到样机\">1882—1887：从直觉到样机</h2><p>按特斯拉本人在自传《我的发明》中的回忆，旋转磁场的构想诞生于 1882 年。他描述自己在布达佩斯的一座公园散步时，背诵歌德《浮士德》的诗句，磁场旋转的图景突然在脑中清晰浮现，他甚至用树枝在沙地上画出了原理。这段叙述的戏剧性使其广为流传，但需谨慎对待——它写于事件数十年之后，细节难以独立核实。</p>\n<p>可考的硬事实是：在 1882 年到 1887 年间，特斯拉先后在巴黎、斯特拉斯堡为爱迪生的欧洲公司工作，1884 年移居美国。1887 年，他在纽约建立实验室，把多年的构想做成了可运转的感应电动机样机。这台样机正是次年专利与演讲的实物基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"旋转磁场的物理本质\">旋转磁场的物理本质</h2><p>旋转磁场可以用最简洁的方式理解。设两路电流相位相差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90°</span></span></span></span></span>，分别通入空间上垂直布置的两组绕组：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i_A = I_m \\cos(\\omega t), \\qquad i_B = I_m \\cos\\!\\left(\\omega t - \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.836em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两组绕组产生的磁动势在空间正交叠加，其合成矢量的模保持恒定，而方向以角速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span></span></span></span></span> 匀速旋转：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{F}(t) = F_m\\left[\\cos(\\omega t)\\,\\hat{x} + \\sin(\\omega t)\\,\\hat{y}\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2163em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对三相系统，三路电流相位互差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120°</span></span></span></span></span>，效果相同且更平稳。转子的转速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 总是略低于旋转磁场的同步转速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，二者之差占比称为转差率（slip）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = \\frac{n_s - n}{n_s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>正是这一点点「滞后」，让转子持续被磁场牵引——若转子追上磁场，相对运动消失，感应电流与转矩也随之归零。这就是「异步电动机」名称的由来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"专利与同时代的竞争\">专利与同时代的竞争</h2><p>1887 年 10 月 12 日特斯拉提交申请，1888 年 5 月 1 日获得专利 US 381,968《电磁电动机》，同期还有 US 382,279 等一组专利，共同覆盖了多相电动机与变压器系统。这组专利的工程完整性，是它日后击败对手的关键。</p>\n<p>必须指出的是，旋转磁场并非特斯拉一人独得的发现。意大利物理学家伽利略·费拉里斯（Galileo Ferraris）于 1885 年独立提出了旋转磁场原理，并在 1888 年 3 月（早于特斯拉的 AIEE 演讲）公开发表。二者的差异在于：费拉里斯更偏理论阐释，且一度认为这类电动机效率有限；特斯拉则把它发展为一套可商业化、可组网的完整电力系统。历史给予特斯拉更高的位置，主要因为他完成了从原理到工业系统的关键一跃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程意义-为何它改变了世界\">工程意义：为何它改变了世界</h2><p>交流感应电动机的真正威力，要放到「电流之战」的背景下才能看清。直流电难以在高压下经济地远距离传输，而交流电可借助变压器自由升降压——升压以减小线损远送，到用户端再降压使用。但交流电要落地为动力，必须有一种能直接吃交流电的可靠电动机，否则工厂宁可守着直流。特斯拉的感应电动机恰好补上了这块拼图，使「高压交流远送 + 末端低压驱动」的完整链条得以闭合。</p>\n<p>今天，全球工业用电的绝大部分由感应电动机消耗，从水泵、风机、压缩机到电梯、机床，其基本工作原理与特斯拉 1888 年的专利一脉相承。这种跨越百余年仍在大规模沿用的连续性，是衡量一项发明分量的最可靠尺度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>旋转磁场是特斯拉最核心的物理洞见：用相位错开的多相交流电产生空间旋转的磁场，从而免去电刷与换向器。</li>\n<li>1887 年做出样机，1888 年 5 月获专利并在 AIEE 宣读论文，奠定现代电力工业基础。</li>\n<li>转差率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是感应电动机运转的关键——转子必须略慢于同步转速才能持续产生转矩。</li>\n<li>费拉里斯独立发现了旋转磁场原理，特斯拉的历史地位主要源于把原理工程化为完整电力系统。</li>\n<li>该原理至今驱动着全球绝大多数工业电动机，是衡量其影响力的最有力证据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"旋转磁场与交流感应电动机","id":"旋转磁场与交流感应电动机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"1882—1887：从直觉到样机","id":"1882-1887-从直觉到样机"},{"level":2,"text":"旋转磁场的物理本质","id":"旋转磁场的物理本质"},{"level":2,"text":"专利与同时代的竞争","id":"专利与同时代的竞争"},{"level":2,"text":"工程意义：为何它改变了世界","id":"工程意义-为何它改变了世界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"多相输电与尼亚加拉瀑布水电站","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/major-works/polyphase-ac-system/polyphase-power-and-niagara-falls"}}